## Root Cause Analysis (RCA)

| Component              | Status                                                           |
| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |
| CPU                    | Healthy                                                          |
| Memory                 | Healthy                                                          |
| Disk                   | Healthy                                                          |
| Network Connectivity   | Healthy                                                          |
| Linux Operating System | Healthy                                                          |
| JBoss Application      | Delayed during initialization                                    |
| DNS                    | Host record unavailable                                          |
| `/etc/hosts`           | Missing hostname entry                                           |
| **Root Cause**         | Repeated hostname resolution timeouts during application startup |

